# AI Agent Todo List & Task Tracking

Maintain structured task management and progress visibility across complex multi-phase execution:

- **Initialize `todo.md`**: Upon receiving a task, create or load `todo.md` at the project root based on `templates/todo.md` and `docs/TODO_LIST_PROTOCOL.md`.
- **Status Markers**:
  - `- [ ]` Pending
  - `- [-]` In Progress (exactly ONE task active at a time)
  - `- [x]` Completed and verified
  - `- [!]` Blocked / Failed (triggers automatic recovery)
- **Plan-Execute-Update**: Update `todo.md` immediately before starting a task and immediately after verifying its completion.
- **Dynamic Recovery Loops**: If an anomaly or test failure occurs, dynamically insert recovery subtasks under the affected item, resolve them, and re-verify before progressing.
- **Completion Gate**: Do not declare success or finalize the packaging report while any pending or in-progress tasks remain in `todo.md`. All items must be marked `- [x]`.
